<title>JAPAN: Japan July platinum imports up 4.1 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan July platinum imports up 4.1 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's platinum imports in July were up 4.1 percent from a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Wednesday showed.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    July 96	 June 96	July 95</p>
<p> Total	    6.92	    4.94	    6.65</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	   1.77	    1.40	    2.99</p>
<p> South Africa   3.03	    2.92	    2.61</p>
<p>Imports in the first seven months of 1996 were 41.97 tonnes, against 42.41 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
</text>
